Semantic --> Bridge : structural semantics
no authority promotion
Expert --> Bridge : production integrity
no automatic compliance
Review --> Bridge : durable review
no truth promotion
Admission --> Bridge : receipt-gated admission
Pareto --> Bridge : work selection
not requirement discharge
Snowball --> Bridge : source role + lineage
no citation authority
Promotion --> Bridge : fail-closed promotion
LegalDecision --> Bridge : coarse official surface
non-factorability
Legitimacy --> Bridge : legality != legitimacy
Fleet --> Bridge : 58-gap scheduling context
584 discharged stay excluded

Bridge --> TOE
Bridge --> Unifier
Bridge --> Validation
TOE --> Validation
Unifier --> Validation
Bridge --> Unified
Validation --> Unified

note right of Bridge
O: converge existing owners
R: reuse before construction
C: one normalization facade
S: preserve non-promotion
L: one disjoint legal-governance lane
P: existing owners + read-only ESD
G: standards are process lenses only
F: root agreement + preflight + trust scan
